<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Pearson, TML launch new firm Feb 1.</title>
<headline>Pearson, TML launch new firm Feb 1.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The business titles and undertaking of South Africa's Business Day, Financial Mail and African Business Channel will be transferred to a new company, BDFM Publishers (Pty) Ltd, from February 1.</p>
<p>The new company will be jointly owned by Britain's Pearson Plc and Times Media Ltd, Pearson said in a statement published here.</p>
<p>The move follows last month's finalisation of Pearson's purchase of a 50 percent stake in the titles for 87.5 million rand.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
